{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>在七月</b> —— 缺 yod，意思是：因诫命而得满足。" "<b>你们要吹响号角</b> —— rashei tevot（首字母缩写）：Shabbat，为要教导，具体来说在院中吹的 yovel 之号声（teki'at yovel）可以越过 Shabbat。"], :book "leviticus", :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :zh-Hans, :chapter 25, :timestamp "2026-07-27T13:55:07.236831043Z", :translated-from :en, :model "glm-5.2"}